7 true] [17592186435824 1071 "Find the value of ${x}_{1}-{x}_{2}$ given that  $4a+3x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}18 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435824 1072 #uuid "e8bdc664-5423-57fc-a753-871b318d24e0" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435824 1074 "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4a+3x & =b \\\\ 3x & =b-4a \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{3}(b-4a) \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{3}([\\begin{aligned}18 \\\\ -15 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}]-4[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]) \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -27 \\\\ -21\\end{aligned}] \\\\ x & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -9 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=2-(-9)=11.$" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435825 1068 #edb/ref 17592186435822 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435825 1069 "q-73950" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435825 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435825 1071 "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435825 1072 #uuid "e9e20ff9-23b3-5457-a430-304f98c0d839" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435825 1074 "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}=-11 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=8 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}=-14\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding the second and the third equations we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{x}_{1} & =-6 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we substitute into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} & =8 \\\\ 4(-1)+3{x}_{2} & =8 \\\\ 3{x}_{2} & =12 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} & =-11 \\\\ 3(-1)-2(4) & =-11 \\\\ -11 & =-11,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=4,$ which means\n\n$$\n-{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-1+4=3.\n$$" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435826 1062 #uuid "130d098a-c26b-57ed-9a17-40b7cc7b707e" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435826 1063 #edb/ref 17592186240990 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435827 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435830 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435827 1062 #uuid "1ba155e6-7a63-58b8-ae54-fd477a157b3e" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435827 1063 #edb/ref 17592186435824 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435828 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435826 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435828 1062 #uuid "35ab3d0c-3feb-5eb0-8af0-2d726c5cb861" 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435828 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342133 13194139534781 17592186045417 true] [17592186435829 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435828 13194139534781 17592186